  "description_html": "Reconstruction of the holotype skull (PIN 3906/2) of the Late Cretaceous sauropod <i>Quaesitosaurus orientalis</i>. Based on Kurzanov &amp; Bannikov 1983,<sup id=\"cite_ref-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> missing elements restored after <i>Nemegtosaurus</i>.<sup id=\"cite_ref-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading4\"><h4 id=\"Color_Key\">Color Key</h4></div>\n<ul><li><b style=\"display:inline-block;line-height:1.7;width:1.7em;margin-right:-1px;border:1px solid #808080;background:#FFD794\" title=\"#FFD794\"> </b> Preserved</li>\n<li><b style=\"display:inline-block;line-height:1.7;width:1.7em;margin-right:-1px;border:1px solid #808080;background:#CD7848\" title=\"#CD7848\"> </b> Missing</li></ul>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading4\"><h4 id=\"References\">References</h4></div>\n<ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite_note-1\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-1\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><cite style=\"font-style:normal\">(1983). \"<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://moam.info/a-new-sauropod-from-the-upper-cretaceous-of-mongolia_5b764105097c4785168b45fe.html\">A new sauropod from the Upper Cretaceous of Mongolia</a>\". <i>Paleontological Journal</i> <b>2</b>: 90−96.</cite></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite_note-2\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-2\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><cite style=\"font-style:normal\">(2005). \"<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.researchgate.net/publication/231914267\">Redescription of the mongolian sauropod Nemegtosaurus mongoliensis nowinski (dinosauria: Saurischia) and comments on late cretaceous sauropod diversity</a>\". <i>Journal of Systematic Palaeontology</i> <